WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.300
Saudi hospitality is famous - you know it from home.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:08.800
When a guest arrives, you welcome them, you make them comfortable, you help them.

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.800
At the stadium, every fan is our guest.

4
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:17.300
Look ready: full uniform, hi-vis, accreditation showing.

5
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:25.300
Use open body language: stand tall, face the fans, hands open, phone away.

6
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.800
Smile and make friendly eye contact.

7
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.500
And speak calmly and clearly.
